                                "sense_id": "2bf12db4-9a2f-37b6-a300-32dbe138b66f",
                                "text": "The Degree of Three Years' Service may be conferred on any one who has been a member of a Woodcraft Tribe for three years, never missing a tribal campout in that time, attending half of the tribal meetings at other times, and having a clear record for law and order."
