                                "sense_id": "2bf12db4-9a2f-37b6-a300-32dbe138b66f",
                                "text": "Even if you have a whole week of vacation and not just a short weekend, for your first campout with small children you are better off planning a trip of only one or two nights until you get the hang of camping."
